    "description": "JVC TC-30 EHG Library Master\nCompact VHS (VHS-C) Cassette Tapes\nLot of 4 Blank Tapes, Factory Sealed\nThe JVC TC-30 EHG is a high-grade Compact VHS cassette engineered for VHS-C camcorders. Developed by JVC, the Extra High Grade formulation uses High Energy Magnetite particles to optimize signal retention, color reproduction, and longevity. Offering 30 minutes of recording time in SP mode and up to 90 minutes in EP mode, these cassettes are ideal for vintage camcorder use, analog video production, and tape preservation.\nHigh Energy Magnetite (Os-85) magnetic tape formulation\nRecording time of 30 minutes in SP mode / 90 minutes in EP mode\nStandard VHS-C format compatible with camcorders and VCR adapters\nLot includes four (4) individually boxed cassettes\nCondition:\nAll four cassettes are brand new and factory sealed in original clear plastic shrink wrap. Packaging remains clean and crisp with tight cellophane and no tears.",
